    {
      "source": "Parse a rather generic Redis response, such as a list of something into a meaningful structure applying best effort\nconversion of <code>byte[]</code> and <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/nio/ByteBuffer.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.nio\"><code>ByteBuffer</code></a>.",
      "translation": "解析一个相当通用的 Redis 响应（例如某个对象的列表），并应用最佳努力策略将其转换为有意义的结构，该过程涉及对 <code>byte[]</code> 和 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/nio/ByteBuffer.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.nio\"><code>ByteBuffer</code></a> 的转换。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Parse a rather generic Redis response, such as a list of something into a meaningful structure applying best effort\nconversion of <code>byte[]</code> and <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/nio/ByteBuffer.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.nio\"><code>ByteBuffer</code></a> based on the sourcePath and a typeHintMap",
      "translation": "解析一个相当通用的 Redis 响应（例如某个对象的列表），并将其转换为有意义的结构。该转换将基于 `sourcePath` 和 `typeHintMap`，尽最大努力对 `<code>byte[]</code>` 和 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/nio/ByteBuffer.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.nio\"><code>ByteBuffer</code></a> 进行转换。",
